    "turn_text": "Welcome to the American Maritime Podcast. I'm your host, Jennifer Carpenter, Vice President of the American Maritime Partnership. If you are new to the American Maritime Podcast, we cover the issues that matter to the 650,000 American men and women who make maritime work in this great country. We are honored to have a very special guest with us today, Congressman Mike Bost of Illinois. Congressman Bost represents the 12th District of Illinois, which covers the southwest part of the state, ranging from East St. Louis to Cairo, and a fun fact about his district, it is one of the very few that contains three navigable rivers. Congressman Bost, welcome. We are honored to have you with us on the podcast today.",
